 * b black	* l		* v value
 * c crown	* m move back	* w white
 * d define	* n no HP use	* x exit
 * e end	* o output	* y you
 * f file,fp	* p print	* z zwart
 * g (game)	* q		* = remise
 * h halt	* r read,rdepth * I I play
 * i info	* s sleep	* : (debug)
 * j		* t time	* \0 (no random)
